    "title": "Where can i watch the Warriors game tonight? How to watch Clippers-Warriors",
    "text": "April 15, 2026, 9:10 p.m. ETThe NBA regular season is over.Now it's time to see who will make the playoffs!The first six seeds in the Eastern and Western conferences are set. But we still have to find out who the seventh and eighth seed will be in the NBA playoffs.Here's what you need to know about NBA Play in game between the Golden State Warriors and the Los Angeles Clippers:Golden State Warriors at Los Angeles ClippersThe Golden State Warriors (37-45) will travel to Los Angeles to play the Clippers (42-4-).When is the Golden State Warriors at Los Angeles Clippers?The game will be played Wednesday, April 15.What time is the Golden State Warriors at Los Angeles Clippers game?The game will start at 10 p.m. EST.What channel is Golden State Warriors at Los Angeles Clippers game on?The game will not air on network television.How to stream Golden State Warriors at Los Angeles ClippersThe game will stream on Amazon Prime Video.Does Golden State Warriors at Los Angeles Clippers winner make playoffs?No. The winner of this game will play the Phoenix Suns, with the winner earning the eighth seed in the playoffs.Golden State Warriors at Los Angeles Clippers predictionGolden State has struggled all year, and they're still banged up. Expect the Clippers to handle them. Prediction: Clippers 117, Warriors 110",
